{"item_uid": "指考98-history-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1997年 聯 合 國環 境 規 劃總 署 在 日 本召 開會 議 ， 提 出 「京 都 議 定書 」（ Kyoto\nProtocol）獲得各國的響應，但美國卻以妨礙經濟發展為由，公開拒絕簽署，\n請問此會議最主要的議題是什麼？", "options": {"A": "地球暖化", "B": "臭氧層", "C": "森林砍伐", "D": "廢棄物污染"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 87.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 98.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 70.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 87.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 70.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 97.0, 92.0, 86.0, 61.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某一制度有下列特徵：國家以法令規範人民；政府編列戶籍，有效掌握稅收；\n官員由中央派任；中央與地方藉文書傳遞訊息。這些特徵與下列何者有關？", "options": {"A": "周公制禮作樂", "B": "秦漢推行郡縣", "C": "歐洲實施封建", "D": "印度種姓制度"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 93.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 100.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 82.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 93.0, "p_high": 100.0, "p_low": 82.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 98.0, 94.0, 75.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "文人賴雨若回想一場激烈的戰役，寫下：「南陲陸戰未停烽，海上旋聞警報重；\n煙鎖基隆橫艦艇，砲轟淡水伏魚龍。」請問該詩句所指之事為何？", "options": {"A": "鴉片戰爭", "B": "牡丹社事件", "C": "中法戰爭", "D": "甲午戰爭"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 75.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 97.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 53.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 93.0, 84.0, 66.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某一作物在明萬曆年間傳入中國，「一畝之收，可敵四十畝。至明末，全國各\n地到處種植。老壯童稚，婦人女子，無不食用，風俗頓壞。」此作物是？", "options": {"A": "甘薯", "B": "煙草", "C": "甘蔗", "D": "鴉片"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 23.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 45.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 29.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 30.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 60.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 29.0, "p_high": 39.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [43.0, 32.0, 27.0, 23.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "甲午戰前，英國在中國的利益遍於南北。甲午戰後，情勢大為不同：東北與長\n城內外、黃河流域、西南和福建分別為俄、德、法和日本的勢力範圍。此時出\n現「門戶開放政策」，主張列強開放在中國的勢力範圍，大家利益均霑。請問：\n此政策由何國提出？實際推動者最可能為何國？", "options": {"A": "美、英", "B": "美、德", "C": "俄、英", "D": "俄、德"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 76.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 88.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 59.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 76.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 59.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 84.0, 79.0, 73.0, 52.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有一本茶書在貢茶鼎盛時出版。在此書的序言中提到：本朝建國初期，每年由\n福建進貢的龍鳳團茶及茶餅，名冠天下。請問這本茶書所敘述的是下列哪一朝\n代的現象？", "options": {"A": "唐", "B": "宋", "C": "明", "D": "清"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 20.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 25.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 18.0, "p_value": 34.0, "p_high": 44.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [47.0, 38.0, 35.0, 31.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在近代亞洲反殖民化運動中，各國領導者大都採「師夷長技以制夷」策略，希\n望引進西方科技以促成國家現代化。但也有領袖鼓吹回歸傳統價值，拒絕工業\n發展，主張以自給自足的鄉村社群為基礎來建國。這應是誰的立場？", "options": {"A": "日本的福澤諭吉", "B": "中國的孫中山", "C": "印度的甘地", "D": "土耳其的凱末爾"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 87.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 67.0, "p_high": 87.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 79.0, 68.0, 56.0, 43.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "現代生活中，有不少事物原本出自十九世紀歐洲人的創意，卻在二十世紀的美\n國變成大眾化消費品，甚至成為美國文化的象徵。下列何者屬之？", "options": {"A": "汽車、電影", "B": "報紙、收音機", "C": "熱狗、麥當勞", "D": "電腦、手機"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 50.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 66.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 34.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [71.0, 58.0, 50.0, 43.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「和內地相比，台灣不失為一塊樂土，各方面的情形也都比內地好。台胞的知\n識水準、守法精神，儉樸耐勞為旅台者所共見。」此段文字的撰寫者應該是：", "options": {"A": "清領末期來台工作的外國商人", "B": "日治時期奉派來台的日本官員", "C": "光復初期來台工作的中國記者", "D": "1970年代在台就學的香港僑生\n- 1 -\n98年指考 第 2 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 26.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 20.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 38.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 67.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 58.0, 50.0, 42.0, 36.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "十六世紀以後，西印度群島大量生產蔗糖，銷往歐洲各國，成為民生必需品。\n十九世紀初，歐陸糖價突漲，影響民生至鉅。導致當時糖價上漲的原因為何？", "options": {"A": "鄂圖曼土耳其帝國切斷歐亞交通，造成歐洲蔗糖短缺", "B": "美國人口大幅成長，蔗糖消耗遽增，使歐洲供應短缺", "C": "拿破崙戰爭時，英國以海軍封鎖歐陸，蔗糖供應短缺", "D": "中南美洲尋求獨立時，對歐實施禁運，蔗糖供應短缺"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 53.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 75.0, "D": 18.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 53.0, "p_high": 75.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 66.0, 53.0, 41.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1903年一位英國記者指出：非洲人完全無法招架白人超強的物質力量，這些力\n量展現於「三合一」的趨勢上。這位記者所說的「三合一」，除軍事主義外，\n還有哪兩種主義？", "options": {"A": "帝國主義、資本主義", "B": "自由主義、保守主義", "C": "社會主義、重商主義", "D": "浪漫主義、理性主義"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 87.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 99.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 68.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 87.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 68.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 93.0, 83.0, 60.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「宇文泰重用蘇綽，制定計賬、戶籍等制度；獎勵清廉，嚴禁貪污，建議裁減\n官員，進行屯田，又作〈六條詔書〉，宇文泰完全採納，令百官誦習。州刺史\n郡 守 縣 官 不 通 六 條 及 計 賬 法 ， 不 許 做 官 。 西 魏 政 治 顯 然 比 東 魏 政 治 好 一\n些， 。」在空格處，應該接著的是哪句話最為適宜？", "options": {"A": "宇文泰選取身體強健的農民組成府兵", "B": "西魏後來成為北周，東魏後來成為北齊", "C": "到孝文帝時進行大規模的華化運動", "D": "宇文氏的政權從此趨於鞏固"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 46.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 62.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 32.0}, "omit_rate": 17.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 62.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [67.0, 53.0, 45.0, 38.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "荷蘭佔領台灣南部初期的競爭對象有三：西班牙人、日本人、鄭芝龍等漢人海\n盜與官商。請問荷蘭人對付這三個競爭對手的策略何者為是？", "options": {"A": "對三者都是一律逐出", "B": "對西班牙人逐出", "C": "對鄭芝龍等漢人抽稅", "D": "對日本人攻擊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 79.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 88.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 79.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 65.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 86.0, 82.0, 77.0, 58.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "宋代以後，出現了自主性的基層組織——宗族，這種組織到了明清時代更為普\n及。下列何者最能顯示宗族之特徵？", "options": {"A": "保甲、團練、鄉約", "B": "鄉約、保甲、義莊", "C": "團練、祠堂、族譜", "D": "祠堂、義莊、族譜"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 72.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 86.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 57.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 57.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 79.0, 72.0, 65.0, 53.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "十五世紀時梵蒂岡一個圖書管理員說：「過去稀有而索價上百金幣的書籍，現\n在只要二十金幣，不論古今，罕有人類發明之重要堪以媲美。」「這項神聖的\n藝術在日耳曼已生根發芽，應移植到羅馬。」這裡說的「發明」是指：", "options": {"A": "活字印刷", "B": "造紙技術", "C": "裝訂書籍", "D": "贊助出版"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 88.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 97.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 76.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 88.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 76.0, "discrimination": 21.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 95.0, 91.0, 84.0, 71.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有一位人士在過世前為自己挑了一塊墓地，表明要在自己的墓碑上寫下「自由\n中國發行人與中國民主黨籌備委員」字樣，以代表他一生從事過最重要的兩個\n志業。這位人士是：", "options": {"A": "楊逵", "B": "胡適", "C": "雷震", "D": "賴和"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 72.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 94.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 16.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 50.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 88.0, 77.0, 63.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "羅馬教廷宣示：教宗是普世的教宗，只有教宗能任命主教，廢黜皇帝；羅馬教\n會過去沒有犯過錯誤，今後也不會犯錯。這種說法最可能在何時出現？", "options": {"A": "六世紀與拜占庭對抗時", "B": "十一世紀末政教衝突時", "C": "十六世紀初宗教改革時", "D": "十八世紀啟蒙運動之時\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 98年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 56.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 12.0, "B": 73.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 36.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 67.0, 59.0, 50.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "班固說：「古代天子建國，諸侯立家，從卿大夫到庶人，各有等差。人們遵奉\n並服事上級，而在下位的人也不會有踰越的念頭。」接著又說：「五霸，三王\n之罪人也；六國，五霸之罪人也；四豪（信陵君等四公子），又六國之罪人也。」\n從班固這兩段敘述我們可以看到怎樣的歷史概念？", "options": {"A": "因果概念，夏、商、周與春秋的結束，是由於在下位的人沒有踰越的念頭", "B": "時序概念，從夏商周到春秋到六國抗秦再到戰國，時間次序不可變更", "C": "證據概念，三王、五霸、六國、四豪，都是古代人們嚴守身分等差的事證", "D": "變遷概念，從夏、商、周到戰國後期，呈現逐漸遠離古代理想的趨勢"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 73.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 93.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 46.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 89.0, 80.0, 65.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "英國詩人但尼生在1847年寫下一首詩：「男人在戶外，女人在家裡／男人使劍，\n女人拿針╱男人有腦，女人有心／男人發號施令，女人順從遵行╱若不如此，\n混亂必行」這首詩反映出十九世紀中葉的哪一種觀點：", "options": {"A": "下層階級因經濟改善，主張女性不必外出工作，可以賦閒在家", "B": "平民階層因工業革命後工作機會大減，主張女性應該在家工作", "C": "中產階級主張女性不應該外出工作，認為男、女內外必須有別", "D": "婦女階層因性別意識高漲，主張女性不需負起家庭經濟的重擔"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 89.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 1.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 84.0, "discrimination": 5.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 87.0, 86.0, 85.0, 83.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下表是和日治時期台灣有關的一項統計數字，請問表中的間數、人數、比率分\n別指的是：\n年度 間數 人數 比率（％）", "options": {"A": "派出所、警察、控制台灣村庄\n1917 327 88,099 13.14", "B": "製糖廠、蔗工、佔日本進口糖 1922 592 195,783 28.82", "C": "公學校、兒童、學齡兒童就學 1937 789 457,165 46.69\n1942 879 745,638 64.81", "D": "火車站、旅客、鐵路到達地方"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 15.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 61.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 11.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 74.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 67.0, 61.0, 54.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "俄國人喜歡用不同的地名來反映政治情勢的改變，下列是同一城市的不同地\n名，請依時序選出正確的排列。", "options": {"A": "聖彼得堡—彼得格勒—列寧格勒—聖彼得堡", "B": "聖彼得堡—列寧格勒—史達林格勒—聖彼德堡", "C": "彼得格勒—列寧格勒—史達林格勒—彼得格勒", "D": "彼得格勒—聖彼得堡—列寧格勒—彼得格勒"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 16.0, "B": 51.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 39.0, "p_value": 10.0, "p_high": 16.0, "p_low": 7.0, "discrimination": 9.0, "p_quintiles": [19.0, 10.0, 8.0, 7.0, 7.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "從魏晉南北朝時期起，中國醫書對瘧疾的記載較多且有相當清楚的認識。出現\n這種醫學知識的主要背景為何？", "options": {"A": "三國以來，中印雙方來往頻繁，行商客旅將瘧疾傳入中國", "B": "西晉末年，華北居民大量南徙，在濕熱環境中感染者日眾", "C": "南北朝時，南北往來頻繁，游牧民族免疫力弱，感染者眾", "D": "北朝之時，胡族入居中原，將北亞草原特殊疾病傳入中國"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 94.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 48.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 74.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 48.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 89.0, 80.0, 65.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "兩位清朝官員談到台灣的械鬥。熊一本說：「兩類肇端，每在連塍（土溝）爭\n水、強割佔耕、毫釐口角，致成大衅。」福康安說：「因閩庄、粵庄彼此交錯，\n田業毗連，遂有構衅相爭之事。」就兩人的說法來看，分類械鬥的起因是：", "options": {"A": "利益競爭", "B": "習慣不同", "C": "官員放縱", "D": "語言隔閡\n- 3 -\n98年指考 第 4 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 93.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 99.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 83.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 93.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 83.0, "discrimination": 16.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 97.0, 93.0, 77.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "新加坡獨立時，李光耀公開聲明：「我們不是華僑，我們只是華裔，這一點無\n人可以更改。中國是中國，我們是我們。」此句話主要的用意為何？", "options": {"A": "中國的施壓引起新加坡人極度的不滿，想撇清與中國的關係", "B": "新加坡長期受到英國的統治，因英國的施壓不得不做此聲明", "C": "新加坡華人經過英國長時期統治，已喪失對中國文化的認同", "D": "適應新加坡的民族與政治情勢，去除印度人與馬來人的疑慮"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 16.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 51.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 77.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 25.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 66.0, 52.0, 37.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列兩段文字，見於何書？（甲）忽報孔明遣人送書至，周瑜覽畢，長歎一聲，\n昏絕，徐徐又醒，仰天長嘆曰：「既生瑜，何生亮？」連叫數聲而亡。（乙）周\n瑜還江陵，為行裝，而道於巴陵病逝，時年三十六，權素服舉哀，感動左右。", "options": {"A": "甲、乙皆見於《三國演義》", "B": "甲見於《三國演義》，乙見於《三國志》", "C": "甲、乙皆見於《三國志》", "D": "甲見於《三國志》，乙見於《三國演義》"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 76.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 93.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 53.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 76.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 53.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 89.0, 81.0, 68.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列有關佛教和基督教發展史的敘述，哪一項是合理的？", "options": {"A": "兩者都有濃厚的民族色彩", "B": "兩者都強調信仰與道德的結合", "C": "兩者都創始於「哲學的突破」時代", "D": "兩者都主張一神論"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 69.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 82.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 57.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 57.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 76.0, 68.0, 61.0, 55.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "十二世紀時一位法蘭西的農民平日生活窮困，也從未離開過自己的家園。但有\n一天，這位農民卻毅然將自己的家當全部變賣，甚至低價出售，只為了籌措出\n外的旅費。請問這位農民離家最可能的目的是什麼？", "options": {"A": "參與英、法百年戰爭", "B": "參加十字軍東征", "C": "躲避黑死病的肆虐", "D": "加入新興的海上探險活動"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 62.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 85.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 37.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 62.0, "p_high": 85.0, "p_low": 37.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 77.0, 64.0, 49.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下表為1995年台灣四個縣某一原住民族群的人數，以及所佔該族群全台總人數\n的百分比，請問它應該屬於哪一族的原住民？\n台北縣 新竹縣 苗栗縣 台中縣\n450(9.6％) 1380(29.4％) 1939(41.4％) 123(2.7％)", "options": {"A": "泰雅族", "B": "布農族", "C": "賽夏族", "D": "排灣族"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 34.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 35.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 22.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 44.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [48.0, 35.0, 31.0, 27.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「政府管制外匯、黃金，以平抑物價。1942年，發行一億美金公債，每一美元\n定價法幣20元，不久黑市高至法幣450元，但有關人士，仍可按官價購進，大\n獲暴利。1943至1945年之間，政府抛售黃金，1944年至1945年，舉辦黃金存款，\n利益多落入大戶之手。」這段敘述最可能和下列哪一議題有關？", "options": {"A": "抗戰後期政府經濟政策與實施情形", "B": "抗戰期間美元與法幣的匯率變化", "C": "抗戰後期政府對銀行、金店、大戶的控制", "D": "抗戰期間政府放任黃金的買賣"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 68.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 88.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 45.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 82.0, 72.0, 58.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1934年《食貨半月刊》創刊，其〈編輯的話〉指出：「史學雖不是史料的單純\n排列，史學卻離不開史料。理論雖不是史料的單純排列可以產生，理論並不是\n原形一擺，就算成功了的。中國社會史的理論鬥爭，總算熱鬧過了。但是如不\n經一番史料的搜求，特殊問題的提出和解決，那進一步的理論爭鬥，斷斷是不\n能出現的。」這位編輯要表達的是：", "options": {"A": "史學研究即是史料學", "B": "史料學可以取代理論", "C": "理論無益於史學研究", "D": "理論建構離不開史料\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 98年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 92.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 99.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 82.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 92.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 82.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 97.0, 94.0, 74.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "施琅在〈恭陳台灣棄留疏〉中提及：「且海氛既靖，內地溢設之官兵，盡可陸\n續汰減，以之分防台灣、澎湖兩處。台灣設總兵一員……又無添兵增餉之費。\n其防守總兵、副、參、游等官，定以三年或二年轉陞內地，無致久任，永為成\n例。」請問施琅這個建議後來演變成：", "options": {"A": "渡台禁令", "B": "團練制度", "C": "班兵制度", "D": "保甲制度"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 83.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 98.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 62.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 83.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 62.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 96.0, 90.0, 81.0, 52.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-032", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "藝術史課堂上，老師在解說一幅宗教壁畫：「在這幅聖像中，人們幾乎看不到\n寫實主義的婦女與嬰兒形象，也感受不到自然主義的人類感情；圖畫本身缺乏\n合理的佈局與比例，古典藝術的和諧與真實情感消失了。畫家用簡潔的線條和\n對比強烈的色彩，以突出聖母的扭曲形象，欲透過帶有特殊含意的線條和色\n彩，來表達重要的神學思想。」這應是何者的藝術風格？", "options": {"A": "古典時期的雅典", "B": "中古時代的拜占庭", "C": "文藝復興的義大利", "D": "啟蒙運動時的巴黎"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 45.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 52.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 32.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 33.0, "p_low": 16.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [38.0, 24.0, 20.0, 17.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-033", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 33, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在一場災難過後，幾位學者對歐洲前途發出這樣的感歎。學者甲說：「我們這\n個時代的現實：歐洲之沒落。」學者乙說：「歐洲已進入了艱困的時代。」學\n者丙說：「我們歐洲的命運只能這樣。」這些學者應是為何而擔憂？", "options": {"A": "宗教改革後，羅馬教會學者對歐洲陷入信仰分裂感到憂心", "B": "法國大革命期間，歐洲保守派對革命運動的傳播深感不安", "C": "第一次世界大戰後，知識份子對歐洲文明的前途失去信心", "D": "冷戰期間，西歐學者對於亞洲新興勢力的崛起，甚為疑慮"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 89.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 38.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 80.0, 66.0, 50.0, 31.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-034", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 34, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列四段有關中共對知識分子思想鬥爭的敘述，請按合於邏輯的次序加以排\n列。（甲）當時毛澤東正想找理由掀起批判胡適的運動，這個事件正好提供引\n爆點，毛澤東說俞平伯販賣胡適思想；（乙）俞平伯是胡適考證《紅樓夢》的\n嫡傳弟子，認為《紅樓夢》是曹雪芹自傳，並從此一觀點考證《紅樓夢》；（丙）\n霎時之間，全國報章雜誌都是批判胡適的文章，由文藝而擴及哲學、歷史等範\n圍，歷時長達一年之久；（丁）引起兩位不知名的山東作家的批評，說他的考\n證方法，是「資產階級的唯心論」，目的在隱晦《紅樓夢》批判封建主義的性\n格。", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙丁", "B": "甲丙乙丁", "C": "乙甲丙丁", "D": "乙丁甲丙"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 67.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 90.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 39.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 67.0, "p_high": 90.0, "p_low": 39.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 84.0, 72.0, 57.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-035", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 35, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "啟蒙哲士伏爾泰談到「誰是最偉大的人」時說：真正偉大的人不是凱撒、亞歷\n山大，這個人必須獲得上天賦予的天分，並以此照亮人們的心智。政治和軍事\n家奴役生靈，這個人則以真理的力量引領我們的心；他瞭解宇宙，而不是摧毀\n宇宙。伏爾泰所推崇的這個人是：", "options": {"A": "哥倫布", "B": "哥德", "C": "盧梭", "D": "牛頓"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 49.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 71.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 38.0, "D": 27.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 49.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 61.0, 49.0, 37.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-036", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 36, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "甲書說：「宗教改革的主因是羅馬教會本身的腐化。」乙書說：「宗教改革起於\n馬丁路德在1517年公開批評天主教會的腐化。」以下哪個敘述較為合理：", "options": {"A": "甲著眼於遠因，乙著眼於近因", "B": "甲著眼於導火線因素，乙著眼於背景因素", "C": "甲著眼於個人因素，乙著眼於制度性因素", "D": "甲著眼於表層因素，乙著眼於深層因素\n- 5 -\n98年指考 第 6 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 62.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 88.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 31.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 62.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 58.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 80.0, 67.0, 48.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-037", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 37, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「鄭成功」，一個幾乎神化的英雄，其事蹟不同時代強調之處有所不同，下列\n哪些解釋是合理的？", "options": {"A": "為感謝鄭氏收復失土，清領初期官方文獻都稱鄭氏為「民族英雄」", "B": "牡丹社事件後，沈葆楨奏請建「延平郡王祠」，表彰鄭氏的「忠君」", "C": "孫中山推行革命，以鄭氏的「反清復明」來呼應他的「驅除韃虜」", "D": "國府遷台後，國民黨推崇鄭氏的「反清復明」，希望能「反攻大陸」", "E": "中共初期強調鄭氏「抗荷」的角色，希望能「抗美帝」以「解放台灣」"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BCDE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 16.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 74.0, "E": 43.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 81.0, "D": 88.0, "E": 59.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 33.0, "B": 56.0, "C": 61.0, "D": 57.0, "E": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 36.0, "p_high": 56.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [61.0, 48.0, 39.0, 28.0, 5.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-038", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 38, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "馮道是五代名臣，作〈長樂老自敘〉，敘述歷事四朝及契丹所得的階勳官爵以\n為榮，自謂為臣為子為父為師，都無愧色。後人對他有些意見，如甲：「他的\n道德如同古代聖賢，才能很高，氣量很大，雖然朝代改變，大家對他均無批評。」\n乙：「我讀馮道的〈自敘〉，看他所說的光榮，真可以說是無廉恥的人，天下國\n家也就可想而知了。」丙：「馮道的行為，很有古人風範；馮道的氣量，深得\n大臣的體要。」在下列敘述中，選出適當者。", "options": {"A": "三種敘述，評價相同，都是讚揚", "B": "甲是批評，丙是事實描述", "C": "乙是讚揚，丙是嚴厲批評", "D": "甲是稱讚，乙是嚴厲批評", "E": "觀點不同，評價有異，馮道即是一例"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "DE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 92.0, "E": 93.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 99.0, "E": 99.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 81.0, "E": 83.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 90.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 75.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 97.0, 95.0, 90.0, 67.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-039", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 39, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一位羅馬作家對時局有這樣的評論：「帝國之內一片昇平，官員的名號一如往\n昔。年輕一代曾目睹共和昔日面目者少之又少！」「國家已經脫胎換骨，昔日\n優美的道德已一絲不存。平等遭到剝奪，所有人都一股腦兒，仰望聽命於第一\n公民一人。」我們如何解讀這份資料？", "options": {"A": "這位作家遭逢從「共和」到「帝制」的轉變", "B": "這位作家口中的「第一公民」指的就是凱撒", "C": "「第一公民」與「奧古斯都」字義並無不同", "D": "「昔日優美道德」是指羅馬的傳統公民精神", "E": "從作家的言論推測，他應是一位共和主義者"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ADE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 86.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 77.0, "E": 84.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 95.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 84.0, "E": 97.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 73.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 68.0, "E": 66.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 61.0, "p_low": 36.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [63.0, 57.0, 52.0, 47.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-history-040", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 40, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "三位史家解釋西元七、八世紀阿拉伯帝國的擴張。史家甲：「阿拉伯人朝向單\n一目標：征服世界，使所有人皈依伊斯蘭教。」史家乙：「穆斯林社區的統一\n可藉由對外攻擊而獲得維持，這也會提升哈里發的權威。」史家丙：「一開始\n的大征服並非伊斯蘭的擴張，而是阿拉伯民族的擴張。」以下何者為是：", "options": {"A": "甲不同意宗教性因素", "B": "乙強調是政治性因素", "C": "丙不同意甲的解釋", "D": "丙著眼於宗教性因素", "E": "甲和乙的說法沒有差別\n- 6 -\n第 7 頁 98年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科\n第第第第 貳貳貳貳 部部部部 分分分分 ：：：： 非非非非 選選選選 擇擇擇擇 題題題題 （（（（ 佔佔佔佔 20 分分分分 ））））"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BC", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 85.0, "C": 87.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 25.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 94.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 15.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 75.0, "D": 14.0, "E": 32.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 54.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 84.0, 77.0, 68.0, 46.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
